<p>An explosion hit at or near the U.S. Embassy compound in Oslo around 1 a.m. local time on Sunday. Authorities said it caused minor material damage, and no injuries were reported; witnesses also described thick smoke in the area. Norwegian police said they were treating the incident as a high-priority investigation, and the cause was still unclear in early reporting.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/ooUiL2tNIC6HgGUgu0RnAxnVxTW3gpdKtFAaKmx_LNLqXN_lqwNYQ4wOq82LpPpuefqb0DdpHDiClhEgKKG0CZ2Fd1IiDRj4_p48cvmahDJs6aMyo6FWQ8l1mgl75EvBpswJIg-hEuulByfecPZArIsiySmhpKmv9t6VKHCQxt1885HbxTUJUMMZQuMffAxdueGtzJKEoKkaJ7L0nDP-NUDW7-oW3P5x4biPSwy6xsrh5tJK9R8mIBTB1-1TLEaMearrY7WcbVIbgWxw4Q' alt='Police vehicles outside the U.S. embassy in Oslo after a loud bang was reported, March 8, 2026.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Search operation: Oslo police used dogs, drones, and helicopters to search for one or more potential perpetrators.</li><li>On-scene response: Police commander Michael Dellemyr said investigators were speaking with witnesses, and TV2 reported a bomb squad was at the scene.</li><li>Damage location: Police said the blast caused only “minor material damage” to one of the building’s entrances.</li><li>Safety update: Several hours later, police said the area around the building was safe for residents and passersby.</li></ul><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>Oslo police: Police said they were investigating the blast as a high priority, with substantial resources, and were searching for one or more potential perpetrators. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1979741/explosion-at-us-embassy-in-oslo-no-injuries'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Norwegian police commander Michael Dellemyr: Dellemyr said police would not comment on what exploded or the type of damage because the investigation was in its early stages. He later said investigators had an idea of the cause, and it appeared to be an act carried out by someone. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1979741/explosion-at-us-embassy-in-oslo-no-injuries'>Dawn</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/explosion-hits-near-us-embassy-in-norway-no-injuries/a-76264170'>Explosion hits near US Embassy in Norway, no injuries</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.ndtv.com/world-news/explosion-hits-us-embassy-in-oslo-causes-minor-damage-thick-smoke-11184392#publisher=newsstand'>Explosion Hits US Embassy In Oslo, Causes Minor Damage, Thick Smoke</a> - ndtv.com</li><li><a href='https://www.thehindu.com/news/international/massive-explosion-near-us-embassy-in-oslo-norwegian-police-say/article70718009.ece'>Massive explosion near U.S. embassy in Oslo, Norwegian police say</a> - thehindu.com</li><li><a href='https://www.scmp.com/news/world/europe/article/3345858/us-embassy-norways-oslo-hit-explosion-no-injuries-police-say'>US embassy in Norway’s Oslo hit by explosion but no injuries, police say</a> - scmp.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c5yjegg892lo'>US embassy in Oslo hit by explosion, Norway police say</a> - bbc.com</li><li><a href='https://www.cbsnews.com/news/explosion-reported-near-u-s-embassy-oslo-norway/'>No injuries after explosion reported near U.S. Embassy in Norway, local police say</a> - cbsnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1979741/explosion-at-us-embassy-in-oslo-no-injuries'>Explosion at US embassy in Oslo, no injuries</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.theglobeandmail.com/world/article-us-embassy-blast-oslo-norway/'>Explosion at U.S. embassy in Oslo caused minor damage but no injuries, Norwegian police say</a> - theglobeandmail.com</li><li><a href='https://www.firstpost.com/world/explosion-rocks-us-embassy-in-oslo-no-casualties-reported-police-13987254.html'>Explosion rocks US embassy in Oslo, no casualties reported: Police</a> - firstpost.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/europe/loud-blast-heard-near-us-embassy-in-oslo-norway-police-say'>Explosion hits US embassy in Oslo, causing minor damage, 